Embedded engine: offline mode (`vericto check --offline`) runs vericto-engine,
Vericto's SQL engine (Copyright 2026 Vericto S.A.S.), compiled into the binary
on every release target (Windows included since 1.11.0) through the default
`offline` feature. Version 2.0.0 of the CLI pins version 5.0.0 of the
engine, which is itself licensed under AGPL-3.0-only, like the rest of the
binary; its entry in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES gives the license of the engine
release a binary pins. vericto-engine releases up to v4.7.1, which
vericto-cli 1.10.0 to 1.13.3 embed (from v4.3.0 on), stay under
FSL-1.1-ALv2. A build without the `offline` feature (`cargo build
--no-default-features`) does not contain the engine.

